    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n37809" root="لعج" body-key="l">
    
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">لَاعِجٌ</span></b> : see 1. ― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b2-  <i>Ardour</i> of love, or desire, or
the like; syn. <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">لَوْعَةٌ</span>. (TA.) ― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b3-  <i>Burning</i> or
<i>ardent,</i> love: (L:) love <i>that burns the heart.</i>
(S.) [See <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">حُبٌّ</span>.] ― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b4-  <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">بِهِ لَاعِجُ الشَّوْقِ</span>, and <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">لَوَاعِجُهُ</span>,
<i>He suffers the burning pain, and pains, of
longing desire.</i> (A.)

